+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/capthvnsen/hermes-conductor/748185fd67f07fdd7d752731a4abfe6cfb4171f4/assets/demo-run.jpg
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/capthvnsen/hermes-conductor/748185fd67f07fdd7d752731a4abfe6cfb4171f4/assets/demo-app.png
+platforms: [linux, macos]
