+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/elijahboston/hermes-corkboard/349d1f8417fb4d3c6cb9ca621cbe5bd7ba11aa0e/docs/screenshots/04-check.png
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/elijahboston/hermes-corkboard/349d1f8417fb4d3c6cb9ca621cbe5bd7ba11aa0e/docs/screenshots/05-dismissed.png
