he text passed or the named regular .md/.txt/.docx file (no symlinks). Writes only under HERMES_HOME/plugin-data/dike: the corpus (about 300 MB, unpacked once after a SHA-256 check, checked by file stat on every call and fully re-hashed once per process), temporary files, engine caches, Case Writer briefs, pseudonym maps (they hold the real values; files 0600) and send and hook logs without content. The Desktop page adds one scoped <style> element and removes it on unload. No network of its own after dependency install, no telemetry, never signs."
